  "keyFeatures": [
    "Persistent AI orchestrator session powered by GitHub Copilot SDK",
    "Multi-interface control via Telegram (remote) and TUI terminal client",
    "Spawns worker Copilot sessions for coding tasks in specific directories",
    "Long-term memory system (preferences, facts, projects, people, routines)",
    "Intelligent model routing — auto-selects fast/standard/premium models by task complexity",
    "Extensible skill system — teach Max new capabilities via SKILL.md documents",
    "MCP server integration via Copilot CLI's mcp-config.json",
    "HTTP API on localhost:7777 with SSE streaming for real-time responses",
    "Session persistence — resumes orchestrator session across daemon restarts",
    "Automatic reconnection and health checks every 30 seconds"
  ],
